  <body>
    <div class="container" id="channel-buffering">
      <h2><a href="./index.html">Go в примери</a>: Складиране в канали</h2>
      
        <div class="row">
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>По подразбиране каналите са <em>нескладиращи</em><sup class="footnote-ref" id="fnref:buffered"><a href="#fn:buffered">1</a></sup>,
което означава, че ще приемат изпратени данни (<code>chan
&lt;-</code>) само ако има някой готов да ги получи (<code>&lt;- chan</code>).
<em>складиращите канали</em><sup class="footnote-ref" id="fnref:unbuffered"><a href="#fn:unbuffered">2</a></sup> приемат ограничено
количество стойности без да има готов получател за тези
стойности.</p>

<div class="footnotes">

<hr />

<ol>
<li id="fn:buffered">buffered channel – канал, складиращ/задържащ в себе си по повече от една стойност от вида на канала данни, буфериран</li>

<li id="fn:unbuffered">unbuffered channel – нескладиращ канал – такъв, през който може да минава само една стойност наведнъж, небуфериран.</li>
</ol>

</div>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code empty leading">
            
          
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            <a href="https://go.dev/play/p/uJseaMntfbk"><img title="Run code" src="play.png" class="run" /></a><img title="Copy code" src="clipboard.png" class="copy" />
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">package</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">main</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;fmt&#34;</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">func</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Тук правим (<code>make</code>) канал за низове с вместимост до
две стойности.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">messages</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nb">make</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kd">chan</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">string</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">)</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Понеже този канал е складиращ, можем да изпратим
тези стойности по канала без съответстващо
едновременно<sup class="footnote-ref" id="fnref:concurrent"><a href="#fn:concurrent">1</a></sup> работещо за всяко изпращане
получаване.</p>

<div class="footnotes">

<hr />

<ol>
<li id="fn:concurrent">concurrent – едновременно (изпълняваща се задача)</li>
</ol>

</div>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">messages</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">&lt;-</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;складиращ&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">messages</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">&lt;-</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;канал&#34;</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>По-късно можем да получим тези две стойности както
обикновено.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="o">&lt;-</span><span class="nx">messages</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="o">&lt;-</span><span class="nx">messages</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
          </div><!-- end class="row" -->
      
